Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:01:00.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:05.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宾夕法尼亚州 伊利）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（19世纪医疗）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:50.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:32.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佛蒙特州 迦南）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（律师禁入 说你呢 别来要捐款 别来兜售东西）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.97,0:30:37.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.59,0:35:12.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（氯仿）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.35,0:38:21.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一年活头了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a year to live, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想好好利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了个新红人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big new up-and-comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的很想把萨姆的内脏插在棍子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she really, really wants Sam's intestines on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是推销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a saleswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也像其他人一样有老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a boss like everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,合同在谁手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who holds the contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉偷了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela stole the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回它 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it back, Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把小手枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little pistol, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你这么做会害死多少人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand how many people are gonna die if you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟以为我打算拿它做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is it that you think I plan to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走我们对付恶魔大军的唯一武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the only weapon we have against an army of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sell it to the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗 我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去找到那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go hunt the bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好怕 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能帮我脱身的就是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only person that can get me out of this thing is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝酒去吗 - 去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up for a drink? - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天一亮就得起床 有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta be up at the crack of dawn. Duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 隆胸吗 - 那还好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A boob job? - I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有个坏脾气老太婆想整整\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, some crabby old broad wants the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要把叉子才能把她都支棱起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a forklift to get it all back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦那么一通 就为了给脸减龄15分钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that work to hack, what, 15 minutes off their faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持年轻是桩残酷的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying young is a brutal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 先生 让我看看发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, sir. Let me see what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我没什么没见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry. There's nothing I haven't seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不 - 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. - Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿开口了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:02:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 萨姆 他什么都不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Sam? He doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那我该向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, then I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来弥补你一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再最后问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的合同在谁手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who holds my contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她弯下身前 她拿给我看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she, uh, showed it to me right before I bent her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or else… - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要把圣水从另一头挤进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna squirt your holy water in both ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 那算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, that's like a flea bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是告诉你什么之后只会更惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}compared to what's coming to me if I tell you jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一怕的就是握着你小命的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I'm scared of is the demon holding your ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样 感觉好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that feel? Does that feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我回地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为等你到了那里 我会等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because when you get there, I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟几个很期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a few pals who are dying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好会会迪恩·温彻斯特的朋友一起迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nice little meet and greet with Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他去再伤害不了其他人的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him someplace he can't hurt anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查了那指纹两次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran the prints twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说是实验室失误吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just chalk it up to lab error.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I know it. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我会转告警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks. Yeah, I'll tell the lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体埋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可怜人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Poor schmuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些恶魔似乎为了寻刺激狠狠地糟蹋了他的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like these demons ride him hard just for kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那通电话怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the phone call about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得昨天报纸上那宗报道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that thing in the paper yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱衣舞娘用丁字裤闷死男子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripper suffocates dude with thighs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个走进急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, the guy that walks into the ER.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻死亡 肠子掉出来的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kneels over dead, his stomach ripped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是他的肝脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}His liver, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 我刚得知了些很有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, I just found out something pretty damn interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面满是血指纹 但不属于被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered in bloody fingerprints. Not the victim's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:44.83,Title,0,0,0,0,,好 我《犯罪现场调查组》的哥们戴维·克鲁索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Great, my man Dave Caruso'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听了肯定高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}stoked to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹匹配一个死于1981年的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those fingerprints match a guy who died in 1981.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀人行尸吗 - 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walking, killing dead? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸们的确喜欢另一种「另类白肉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zombies do like the other "other white meat."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 你为什么在乎僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, what do you care about zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几个月来一直忙于拯救灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You've been on soul-saving detail for months now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩三周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're three weeks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却突然想去灭僵尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of a sudden you're interested in some hot zombie action?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 是你一心想去猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're the one who's been all gung ho to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会喜欢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I'd be doing you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say I didn't wanna do it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想去猎僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna hunt some zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 身体剩余部分没有被动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, the rest of the body was intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏是唯一缺失的器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The liver was the only organ missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏被扯出的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where the liver was ripped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否发现有牙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you happen to notice any teeth marks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以出示下你们的警徽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see your badges?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们是警察还是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, so you're cops and morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我们很聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me? No, no, we're very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏不是扯出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The liver was not ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用手术手法切除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was removed. Surgically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人很会使用手术刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}By someone who knew their way around a scalpel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没读我的报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you read my report?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然读了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,引人入胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, uh, riveting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩纷呈 爱不释卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real page-turner. Just delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我们的僵尸理论是站不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that kinda punches a hole in our zombie theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术刀什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that scalpel thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:36.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,嗯 会技术的僵尸 《僵尸女医生》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Zombie with skills? Dr. Quinn, medicine zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们查错了方向 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're on the wrong track, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该找被切过的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for hacked-up corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we be looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是僵尸午餐 而是器官盗窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't zombie lunch. This is organ theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天都跟警察说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the cops all of this yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就问几个问题 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple questions, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我刚被人盗了肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I just got my kidney stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be out of here quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不想抓到那人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't you wanna get the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肾脏能回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it get me back my kidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你最后记得的事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what's the last thing you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给停车表投币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding my meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被从后面偷袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm jumped from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我醒来时 就被绑在了张台子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I wake up strapped to a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是超乎你想象的剧痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the worst pain you could possibly imagine, only worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我又昏了过去 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I black out again, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我在个小旅馆里尖叫着醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I wake up screaming in some no-tell motel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在一浴缸冰水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a bathtub full of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得手术的什么细节吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything about the surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人的样貌 房间的具体情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the guy looked like, any details about the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let me think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回忆起来一件事了 知道我记得什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing is coming back to me. You know what I remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肾脏被切掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting my kidney cut out of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个理论 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I got a theory. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我跟那位暴躁先生的医生谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I talked to Mr. Giggles' doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 他的切口是用丝线缝合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, his incisions were sewn up with silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奇怪啊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's weird. - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现如今是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}nowadays it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在19世纪初 丝线可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But silk used to be the suture of choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,首选缝合线\N{\fnArial\fs30}back in early 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时问题很大 病人会严重感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was problematic. Patients would get massive infections.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡率非常高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death rate was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好时代啊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good times. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以医生们得尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So doctors they had to do whatever they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免感染的扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep infections from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种办法就是用蛆\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way was maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我吃饭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且效果很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It actually kinda worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为蛆只吃坏组织 而不碰好组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}because maggots, they eat bad tissue and they leave good tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 那人被发现时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get this, when they found our guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内塞满了蛆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}his body cavity was stuffed full of maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我吃饭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人在被劫持 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So people are getting ganked, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,古董巡回手术窃取器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little Antiques Roadshow surgery, some, some organ theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么听上去那么耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this all sounding familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you heard it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你还小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,班顿医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc Benton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾生活在新罕布什尔的真医生 很天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real-life doctor, lived in New Hampshire, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,痴迷于炼金术 尤其是永生之法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And obsessed with alchemy, especially how to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,1816年 医生抛下了他的诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in 1816, Doc abandons his practice…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 之后20年都没人有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, nobody hears from him for like 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后突然开始有人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden people start showing up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡 或丢失器官 或手 或其他身体部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or missing an organ, or a hand, or some other kind of part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他不管做了什么 真的成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause whatever he was doing was actually working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的生命不断延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just kept on ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,器官用坏 他就拿新的换上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parts would wear out, he'd replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸不是猎到了他 挖出了他的心脏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Dad hunted him down and took his heart out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 医生肯定是按上了新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess the doc must've plugged in a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他在哪干坏事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where's he doing the deed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面说 班顿对实验室的选址很挑剔\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, Benton's picky about where he sets up his lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢浓密的森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes dense forest…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近河水或溪流 某种活水的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}with access to a river or stream or some kind of fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他喜欢在那里丢弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's where he likes to dump the.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,内脏和粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}bile, and intestines, and fecal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没胃口了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost your appetite yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我才没法生你气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I can't stay mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是旧狩猎小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these are all old hunting cabins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大都废弃多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've mostly been abandoned for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能总算有贝拉的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I finally got a beat on Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是种性姿势吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that like a Cleveland Steamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个猎人 至少以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hunter, or used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上是个隐士 也卖东西作为副业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermit, mostly. Does a little selling on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我几个月前发话出去打听贝拉的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I put the word out on Bela months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚来电了 说有个女人联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just called, said a woman got in touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想买点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanted to buy some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他觉得是贝拉吗 - 英国口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he thinks it's Bela? - British accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了米娜·钱德勒这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went by the name Mina Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字她用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's used that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺大意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's kind of a sloppy move, isn't it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系你的一个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting in contact with one of your old friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 我们15年没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend? Haven't laid eyes on him in 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会寄圣诞贺卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not the Christmas-card type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她恐怕不知道我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt she knows I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛蒙特州 迦南\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canaan, Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 鲍比 我们就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Bobby, we're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带一瓶尊尼获加蓝牌威士忌去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a bottle of Johnnie Walker Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们去找贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We're going after Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on a second… - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿东西 时间不等人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your stuff, the clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该留下 查完案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think we should stay here and finish the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 她不可能还留着柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there's no way she still has the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是几个月前了 她八成刚拿到就卖出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was months ago. She probably sold it the second she got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就杀了她 双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I'll kill her. Win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - Sam, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this, this here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what's gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 找个弗兰肯斯坦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Chasing some Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,班顿死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Benton can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查明他怎么做到的 就能让你也那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find out how he did it, we can do it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.85,0:14:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得先死然后才会下地狱 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to die before you go to hell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你死不了 - 等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if you can never die… - Wait, wait, wait. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从一开始就知道这是班顿医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that this was Doc Benton from the jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是希望 - 所以僵尸什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I was hoping… - So the whole zombie thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是骗我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没确定之前不想说什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna say anything until I was sure, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想找到个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm trying to do is find an answer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是在找一个把人切开的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what you're trying to do is chase Slicey McHackey here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了杀他吗 不 你想请他喝啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to kill him? No, you wanna buy him a freaking beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想研究他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna study him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了 如果我想钻空子 你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget that if I welch on this deal, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 永生就是钻空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what? Living forever is welching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那不管有什么魔药 我也服下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then whatever the magic pill is, I'll take it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:03.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,这算什么 《席德与南茜》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, Sid and Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就像鲍比一直说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just like Bobby's been saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了手握合同的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill the demon that holds the contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事就都打消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this whole damn thing wipes clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最佳机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便你拿到了柯尔特枪 迪恩 你要冲谁开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you had the Colt, Dean, who you gonna shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道合同在谁那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea who holds the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就在地狱之犬咬碎我前打死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shoot the Hellhounds then, before they slash me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不能允许你一个人进入森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause, I'm not gonna let you wander out in the woods alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪一个偷器官的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}to track some organ-stealing freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不允许我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们的目标是一致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, we're trying to do the same thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你要留下 留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wanna stay, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 多小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我是 问题不变 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, even if I am, the question is still the same. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩·温彻斯特 鲍比·辛格的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean Winchester, I'm a friend of Bobby Singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今早给他打过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟鲍比说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个英国妞联系过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a British chick, made contact with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道她在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 可以告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Could you tell me where I could find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 鲁弗斯 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Rufus, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let me point something out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你来敲我的门 别来什么「听着 伙计」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are knocking at my door, so don't "look, man" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我跟你讲个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm gonna tell you a little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一段时间前 鲍比打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, once upoin a time, Bobby called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我有这个贝拉·塔伯特的消息就联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asked me to call him if I got a whiff of this Bela Talbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有她消息了 就打给了他 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a whiff, I called. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 麻烦你告诉我她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. If you could just tell me where she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩·温彻斯特 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean Winchester, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我看上去像是想帮你的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do I look like I'm here to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就滚出我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get the hell off my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hey, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one more question for you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.81,0:17:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I got this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}this bottle of Scotch and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是好酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this considered good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是这玩意 我根本不喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't even bother drinking unless it's this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼浆玉露啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nectar of the gods, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 换换口味真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a nice change, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的威士忌大都是塑料壶装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of my whiskey comes from a plastic jug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉来找你是为了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Bela was here because…?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想买几样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to buy a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点时间找齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is gonna take me some time to round up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 能问你件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩三周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three weeks left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you wasting your time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪那个高傲消瘦的英国妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}chasing after that skinny, stuck-up English girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很多人的很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a lot of things about a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一把玩具枪是救不了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know ain't no pea shooter gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是工作性质 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's the job, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便你这次侥幸活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you manage to scrape out of this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后还会有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's just gonna be something else down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks like us…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没有幸福结局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there ain't no happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都注定有那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是乐观呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't you a bucket of sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你活下来的话 可以期待的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm what you've got to look forward to if you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你活不下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦南旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hotel Canaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,39号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我应付得来贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can handle Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解她的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things that you don't know about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:20:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道事\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你提到了她的指纹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess, you lift her fingerprint?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.25,0:21:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但什么都没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that got you jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她烧掉了指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She burned them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能都好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那你跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so you're right where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.23,0:21:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过她的耳朵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do her ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过她的耳朵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do her ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我插过她的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I do her…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我什么都愿试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'll try anything once,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道 那听上去不太舒服呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know, that sounds uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵对于人 如指纹一样独特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears are as unique to humans as fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 这边的法庭是不认的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course, that don't fly in the courts over here, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}in England?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很认这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个朋友的朋友的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of a friend of a friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天内就给我传真来了10页的机密文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}faxed me 10 pages of confidential files within a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只给他寄去了一张清晰的监控截图\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I had to send him was one clean shot off the security cam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她耳朵的清晰截图\N{\fnArial\fs30}One clean shot of her ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.38,0:22:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The so-called Bela Talbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:24:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.82,0:25:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you, I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.86,0:25:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.24,0:25:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.91,0:25:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.79,0:25:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm sorry. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, watch your head. Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.86,0:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be fine, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柯尔特枪呢 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the Colt? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.88,0:27:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No extra words.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,早没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.63,0:27:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都在世界另一边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the world by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以联系买家 会波斯语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call the buyer. Speak Farsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.85,0:27:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,少臭美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.60,0:27:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 不在我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.65,0:27:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我绝对相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm definitely gonna take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.53,0:27:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.05,0:28:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.59,0:28:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上飞机吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on a plane if you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那买家 你或许最终能追上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track down the buyer. You might catch up to him, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.27,0:28:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.73,0:28:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.11,0:28:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是冷血的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the cold-blooded type.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你那样冷血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.36,0:28:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想象杀我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I couldn't imagine killing my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你说… - 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what you're talk… - Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.37,0:28:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时多大 14岁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were, what, 14?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.79,0:28:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母死于可疑车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your folks die in some shady car accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.13,0:28:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方怀疑刹车线被剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}police suspected a slashed brake line…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但烧得无法分辨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was all too crispy to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而小贝拉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut to little Bela…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.63,0:28:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.13,0:28:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承了百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inheriting millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.43,0:28:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知… - 不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you even…? - Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.83,0:29:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were lovely people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并因此有钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.30,0:29:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be bothered to give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我也不在乎你的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I don't care what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.77,0:29:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.13,0:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.41,0:30:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.84,0:30:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆没一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam wasn't with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.51,0:31:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.14,0:31:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到柯尔特枪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get the Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那贝拉… - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So does that mean Bela is, uh…? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她该死十几遍 但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves to die a dozen times over, but I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.31,0:31:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我真完蛋了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - I'm really screwed, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.23,0:31:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你… - 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're just… - Look, you were right,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.82,0:31:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找贝拉是白费功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, Bela was a goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.20,0:31:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CoIt's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.11,0:31:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这次真完蛋了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time I'm really screwed, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.99,0:31:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.15,0:31:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我找到了班顿的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I found Benton's cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 他在那里吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? Was he there? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.87,0:31:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你杀掉他了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you kill him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么叫没有 - 迪恩 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, no? - Dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.37,0:31:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了他的实验笔记 上面有秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found his lab book and it has the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.00,0:31:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 永生秘方吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, the live-forever formula? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.13,0:31:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我猜猜 我要拿婴儿头骨喝血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, let me guess, I gotta drink blood out of a baby's skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.97,0:31:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 问题就在这里 这不是黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's the thing, it's not black magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.05,0:31:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有血祭什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no blood sacrifice or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.81,0:31:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是科学 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just science, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常奇怪的科学 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very, extremely weird science, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.90,0:31:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得… - 迪恩 我觉得或许可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think…? - Dean, I think it might be doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.15,0:31:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们遭遇了很多挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know we've hit a lot of walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这个秘方 可能是解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I mean, I think this formula, I think it might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.82,0:32:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这或许能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这个秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so this formula…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.53,0:32:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没安全呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, look, we're not in the clear yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.37,0:32:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些地方我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are still things that I don't get…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.79,0:32:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.85,0:32:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.10,0:32:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.19,0:32:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nothing gonna happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.98,0:32:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要发生的事 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you got to worry about, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.19,0:32:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从手术中活下来的几率\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your chances of coming out of this procedure alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.32,0:32:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}very, very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.65,0:32:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.79,0:32:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是个怪物 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm some kind of monster, don't you? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.63,0:32:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:33:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未做过什么我不非得做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never done one thing that I did not have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.34,0:33:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生什么的 损耗很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole eternal life thing is very high-maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.89,0:33:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么坏掉了 比如我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something goes bad, like my eyes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.39,0:33:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得拿新的换\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.23,0:33:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时 有些东西被损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes, things get damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如当你父亲挖出我的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}like when your father cut out my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.95,0:33:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.49,0:33:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就特别不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was very inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.58,0:33:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定能想象 我在他的日记里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm sure that you can understand all the joy I felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,读到自己时 心情多愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I read all about myself here in his journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes this whole thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.23,0:33:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像种家庭团聚 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just feel like some kind of family reunion, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.19,0:34:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们现在该开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess it's about time that we get this thing started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.69,0:34:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.95,0:34:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生你是哪里不明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of immortality do you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.50,0:34:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity about the heart, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.83,0:35:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是新的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a brand-new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.92,0:35:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.67,0:35:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该泵得很有力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be pumping nice and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.09,0:35:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这玩意送遍你全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending this stuff throughout your whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.97,0:35:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼上拿了一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I picked up your little bottle upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.39,0:35:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在刀上沾了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dipped the knife in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.87,0:35:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.58,0:35:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来啦 吃早餐啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakey wakey eggs and bakey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.75,0:35:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你 - 求什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Please what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.71,0:35:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀人杀了150多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been killing poor bastards for over 150 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.83,0:35:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还要提要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you got a request?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.88,0:35:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他切成小块\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to cut him open into litlle bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.13,0:35:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这永生什么的真麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this immortality thing is a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.30,0:35:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你解读秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read the formula for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.40,0:35:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, immortality…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远年轻 永远不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever young, never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.35,0:36:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.99,0:36:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.00,0:36:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.09,0:36:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是三周后下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're talking hell in three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.46,0:36:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是半个世纪后需要换个胰脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}or needing a new pancreas in what, half a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.51,0:36:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那玩意可不是便利店就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, you can't exactly get those at a Kwik-E-Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.22,0:36:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.01,0:36:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能给我们争取时间 想更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it buys us more time to think of something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.30,0:36:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是需要时间 迪恩 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need time, Dean. I mean, please, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.22,0:36:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.39,0:36:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.19,0:36:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你不想活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, don't you wanna live?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.11,0:36:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那不叫活\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he is isn't living.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.19,0:36:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很简单 - 简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, this is simple. - Simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.61,0:36:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说就是很简单 黑白分明 人怪分明\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me it is, okay? Black or white. Human, not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.65,0:36:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, what the doc is…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a freaking monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:36:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.24,0:36:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.45,0:37:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.29,0:37:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要解决了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不帮我自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either help me or not. It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.45,0:37:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.54,0:37:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.13,0:37:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在里面享受永生吧 医生 - 我可以救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enjoy forever in there, Doc. - I can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.80,0:37:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.63,0:37:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.63,0:37:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.05,0:37:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:38:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.26,0:38:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.69,0:38:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, let me out, let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.56,0:38:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去 放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out, let me out, let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事你可能不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a fun fact you may not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.14,0:39:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷走旅馆收据时 我感到你手摸我兜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt your hand in my pocket when you swiped that motel receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.35,0:39:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.96,0:39:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我很清楚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure I understand perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.27,0:39:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你的旅馆房间里注意到了一件有趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I noticed something interesting in your hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.85,0:39:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就掖在门上方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tucked above the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.65,0:39:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}An herb.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.06,0:39:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,荚莲树皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's shoestring?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意只有一种用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's only one use for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.57,0:39:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵御地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding Hellhounds at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.99,0:39:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你知道我做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.57,0:39:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去又看了一遍你父母的讣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back and I took another look at your folks' obit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.87,0:39:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 他们是十年前的今天死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, they died 10 years ago today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.58,0:39:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.37,0:39:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个恶魔替你下的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon did your dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.21,0:39:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了交易 是吧 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a deal, didn't you, Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.79,0:39:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,收债的日子要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's come due.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.43,0:40:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以替你解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不用付出什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't even cost you anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年里都不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 10 whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.11,0:40:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才偷走了柯尔特枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is that why you stole the Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.99,0:40:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想摆脱你的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to wiggle out of your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.36,0:40:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的枪换你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our gun for your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.99,0:40:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.99,0:40:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜偷柯尔特枪还不够 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stealing the Colt wasn't quite enough, I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.70,0:40:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们改变了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}They changed the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.41,0:40:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我杀了萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted me to kill Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.33,0:40:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.96,0:40:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔这么不守信用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons untrustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,震惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.80,0:40:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,截止日期快到了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, kind of a tight deadline too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.92,0:40:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.59,0:40:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 马上午夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, almost midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.89,0:40:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen, I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.01,0:40:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 那早来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, we are weeks past help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.72,0:40:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I don't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.39,0:40:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你说对了 你不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, you're right, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.60,0:40:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但知道最可惜的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what the bitch of the bunch is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.35,0:40:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你肯早点来找我们求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would've just come to us sooner and asked for help…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.57,0:40:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许还能拿柯尔特枪救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we probably could've taken the Colt and saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 也救你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and saved yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.03,0:41:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的交易 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about your deal, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.95,0:41:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.20,0:41:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握合约的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon that holds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.87,0:41:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也掌握了我的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}She holds mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.99,0:41:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她掌握着所有的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she holds every deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.75,0:41:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她吗 - 她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She? - Her name's Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.46,0:41:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.34,0:41:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.92,0:41:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有理由 但这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't, but it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.76,0:41:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮不了你 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't help you, Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.97,0:41:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在太迟了 你为什么要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.59,0:41:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你或许能杀了那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because just maybe you can kill the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.52,0:41:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in hell.
